# The unrelated Slimies app at the repo root isn't part of this deployment.
# Excluding its public/ folder also stops Vercel from serving those files at "/"
# ahead of the Shop Board routes. Leading slashes anchor to the repo root, so
# shop/public is unaffected.
/public
/server.js
/slimies.db
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
